        "232",
        "1086"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eacfcf30ae931bae892b8ece",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想起了同伴呢。——别看我是独自一人旅行，\n我可是胸怀着许多热烈的情感在航海的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f484ab09c49855f0338c647bea67c2139cfc3373b6bf2ac8306a76a053cd004",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1087"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aa5dbb17d103ae1e5ef73c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然是，我的everything！\n我想要你们狂热的视线，更多，再多一点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0c829a31267ff35ac41acc0d5de93b4f0d2e8e4f67f203f58b3580269d6a137",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1088"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f849635340bb07619b6781f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然是，和同伴汇合开party啦！\n大吃大喝，大声喧闹，再美美睡一觉refresh！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1524bb5f0c353d06d1554c3fc7dd604a9c442c8c1cf880b255405231ab7b01ed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
