      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能将里见之名铭刻在历史中，我很自豪！\n今后我想要朝着更高的目标前进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "992e98fc1f2d1de1c6a0b08d2f47b6e69a468f744caa7c7a4a28df5f65b2617b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cb2df4afa05a0c67dc99ec5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能向大家展现出最棒的赛事……最棒的魔术幻影，\n是我的荣幸……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd289a590ff73457697b03c3a464704694795629f694284b1ea277bdaedb3319",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:928319ae6cb21d74f25353b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是啊，因为今天是大吉的日子！\\n我相信自己不管怎么做都能够获胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa9ec4b0e39213eb9843a6117b04c054812f5de460c2cdae4b209d30b748b098",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa94a570193cd9afd4c80a88",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "欸，那个……因为拼尽全力了，不太……\n记得清了……非常抱歉……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6282c2cefd185a7bcc784bdf1c6c7d17848a7a316d9938d7ee5ccfeb4be622b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61ec89d171cd9711bdd1955f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个，首先是家人……然后，\n那个……还有远在海外的，青梅竹马。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec7b5ceb3a8aa4f423d682f4a94857c8d1b4eda783632e2ade6c169b2c75c234",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbf3edb85b157508ba1f3a01",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……这样，宠溺自己真的好吗。\n那个，如果能赢到最后的话，我会考虑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf9c5026d4b2d605876027bdbf14c411246794ebe3e331298230bb81643786d5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94511105e9240323f21ca517",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎、这个，大、大家都很强！\n所以……这、这个问题连我都想问了……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9a84b5740ed8a31622ab20c7e602796de283e9f7ad1f4730d944a1efb1f302b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecaa1ef50f729aaba20205cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "开反省会……因为我，并没有什么\n能做到完美的事情……即使赢了，也一定要开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ae0ed474ed2e45b681a6efd739259c2cf46f2578b49f3734c597c06875e1c09",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a4bd63a62a14bdd16eace9c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……这样，宠溺自己真的好吗。\n那个，如果能赢到最后的话，我会考虑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf9c5026d4b2d605876027bdbf14c411246794ebe3e331298230bb81643786d5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:754e7e0033d9749b88c97d1f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎、这个，大、大家都很强！\n所以……这、这个问题连我都想问了……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9a84b5740ed8a31622ab20c7e602796de283e9f7ad1f4730d944a1efb1f302b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
