      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:153d7ddf970470fb8b6cb34a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……每天，我都会告诉自己。\n别垂头丧气，总之先去做。大概是，这个吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f456cdcd245cedc5242546f63cbbf4639ce44611484549fc9f8e41b645dfd36",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae981881188142f91492788d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "放心下来后，感觉好累。……不过，今天\n我也许可以，稍微表扬一下自己了吧……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2ab686e4e7ddea923f96d52c85f296a25f469a579119d4b5381c50037e0a588",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c8fe8393b09abbdb6cfe488",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "原本想在脖子上挂一尊黄金不倒翁！\\n但因为太重所以就作罢了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3782559885dd9104c6ccca37f7f32bfc7b7515e6f4fd76e985fe8e55504ec2d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb6b43980516c1429f24b661",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……每天，我都会告诉自己。\n别垂头丧气，总之先去做。大概是，这个吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f456cdcd245cedc5242546f63cbbf4639ce44611484549fc9f8e41b645dfd36",
